<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Heaven makes 7.2 mln rand Australian buy.</title>
<headline>Heaven makes 7.2 mln rand Australian buy.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Sweets from Heaven Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it had acquired 100 percent of its Heaven Australia sister company for 7.2 million rand.  </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
